---
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import "../styles.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About ANU accommodation</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Nav />
    <main class="wide">
      <h1>About ANU accommodation</h1>
      <p>
        ANU offers on-campus residential accommodation across 19 halls, colleges and lodges, listed publicly at
        <a href="https://study.anu.edu.au/accommodation/our-residences">study.anu.edu.au/accommodation/our-residences</a>.
        Between them they cover both undergraduate and postgraduate students, with catering arrangements ranging
        from fully catered through flexi-catered to fully self-catered, and published weekly rates starting from
        around $319.
      </p>
      <p>
        Room types span single rooms and shared multi-bedroom apartments through to self-contained studios, with
        many residences offering ensuite bathrooms, shared kitchens, laundry facilities and communal spaces such
        as music rooms, games rooms and study areas. Most residences also run their own wellbeing and community
        programs, and sit on or near campus, within walking distance or along the ANU Civic Loop shuttle route.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
